      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "Every 20 years, life from across the galaxy gather for the space olympics.
    A competitive event created after the 2457 interstellar war. Instead of fighting
    for freedom and territory, species now compete through high speed races around
    Saturn\u2019s ring. They are racing for the official prize, a golden cup symbolizing
    peace and dominance. But most of all is its true reward, a secret reward that
    is far more valuable than the golden cup, a rare resource known only as \u201Cmoon
    cheese\u201D Only one racer can take it home.\n"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 934e340a3cc85b94ab510a7cca9f2181, type: 2}
  m_sharedMaterial: {fileID: 7080155631383302950, guid: 934e340a3cc85b94ab510a7cca9f2181, type: 2}
