  m_text: "Every 20 years, life from across the galaxy for the space olympics. A
    competitive event created after the 2457 interstellar war.Instead of fighting
    for freedom and territory, species now compete through high speed races around
    Saturn\u2019s ring. And they are racing for the official prize, a golden cup
    symbolizing peace and dominance. But most of all\nis its true reward, a secret
    reward that is far more valuable than the golden cup, a rare resource known only
    as \u201Cmoon cheese\u201D And only one racer can take it home.\n"
